anner for servers. Edge applications use an external scanner.$sscb$, $sscb$Internal legacy subnets are still quarterly. Do not describe coverage as weekly everywhere.$sscb$, $sscb$quarterly$sscb$, $sscb$2026-01-20$sscb$::date, '{}'::jsonb),
